        "text_block_yQccWk": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "we give a s#!t about your feet",
            "text": "<p>We care about your feet and we believe comfort & breathability is the ultimate performance flex. To this end, we design golf shoes that complement the natural shape and movement of your feet for unmatched comfort on the links.<\/p><p><br\/><\/p><p>Free your feet from over engineered foot cages that trap heat and experience foot freedom with TRUE.<\/p><p><\/p><p><\/p>",
            "link": "",
            "button_text_1": "",
            "button_link_1": "",
            "button_type_1": "primary",
            "button_text_2": "",
            "button_link_2": "",
            "button_type_2": "primary"
          }
        },
        "text_block_e7jCNn": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Designed for breathability",
            "text": "<p>Our shoes feature a minimalist design with breathable materials, ensuring maximum airflow to keep your feet cool and dry. Known for their lightweight and flexible construction, they provide excellent traction and stability.<\/p><p><br\/><\/p><p>Making them ideal for golfers seeking a blend of style, comfort, and functionality.<\/p>",
            "link": "",
            "button_text_1": "",
            "button_link_1": "",
            "button_type_1": "primary",
            "button_text_2": "",
            "button_link_2": "",
