        "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Wide_golf_shoes_3.jpg",
        "image_position_desktop": "right",
        "image_position_mobile": "top",
        "heading": "PROVEN AT THE HIGHEST LEVEL",
        "text": "TRUEs are laced up by hundreds of thousands of golfers every weekend, including those at the very highest level. PGA Tour players, DP World Tour players and former Ryder Cup players to name a few. All of them chose TRUE for one reason - because they're better for your feet, and your game. After all, comfort is the ultimate performance flex.",
